# Directory spec for the `agent` crate: shipped binary + reusable library + package
# tooling assets. Submodules and asset trees are specified by nearer specs.

Spec: agent

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  The `agent` binary run inside Kubernetes Jobs and the developer CLI. It performs the actual
  work a Job is dispatched for: the package OCI lifecycle (build, update, test, validate,
  lint), instance operations (install, delete, backup, restore) for the three instance kinds,
  CRD generation, and box/template/run utilities.

Structure:
  ./src/main.rs: Binary entrypoint and clap `@Commands` dispatch (./src/main.sdd)
  ./src/lib.rs: Library-target shim (`client`) — lint attributes + `pub mod testing;` only
  ./src/package/: Package lifecycle subcommands, lint, and OCI packaging (./src/package/*.sdd)
  ./src/{system,service,tenant}/: Per-kind instance operations (*/mod.sdd + leaf *.sdd)
  ./src/linting/: Static lint of package structure, Handlebars, and Rhai (./src/linting/*.sdd)
  ./src/testing/: `agent package test` engine and Rhai regression harness (./src/testing/*.sdd)
  ./src/boxes/: box and file-scan operations (./src/boxes/*.sdd)
  ./src/crdgen.rs: CRD manifest generation (./src/crdgen.sdd)
  ./src/run.rs: `agent run` script runner (./src/run.sdd)
  ./src/template/: `agent template` render helper (./src/template/*.sdd)
  ./src/version.rs: version subcommand (./src/version.sdd)
  ./templates/: Job/package Handlebars templates packaged into the image
  ./scripts/: Rhai scripts packaged into the image
  ./tests/: Rust integration and Rhai regression tests
  ./Dockerfile: Runtime image build (contract in ./Dockerfile.sdd)
  ./parent.toml: Standalone workspace manifest used only by the image build (generated)
  ./providers.tf: OpenTofu provider pins pre-seeded into the image

Owns:
  ./src/main.rs
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./parent.toml
  ./providers.tf
  ./templates/**
  ./scripts/**

References:
  ./src/main.sdd, ./src/run.sdd, ./src/crdgen.sdd, ./src/version.sdd,
    ./src/system/{mod,install,delete}.sdd, ./src/service/{mod,install,delete,backup,restore,reconfigure}.sdd,
    ./src/tenant/{mod,install,delete,backup,restore,reconfigure}.sdd,
    ./src/template/{mod,tenant,service,system}.sdd, ./src/boxes/{mod,scan,file_scan}.sdd,
    ./src/package/{mod,build,lint,update,validate,unpack,test}.sdd,
    ./src/testing/{handler,result,vyniltest,vyniltestset}.sdd, ./src/linting/{mod,config,hbs_checker,rhai_checker}.sdd
    — the file-level contracts; this directory spec stays coarse and defers all file behavior
    to them. Two shims carry no file spec per `.specdd/bootstrap.project.md`: `./src/lib.rs`
    (4 lines: the shared `/linting.sdd` attribute pair + `pub mod testing;`; its `[lib]`
    target is named `client` in ./Cargo.toml — the path the binary and integration tests use
    to reach the harness) and `./src/testing/mod.rs` (private mods + four `pub use`
    re-exports only). Service/tenant `reconfigure.rs` are OUT OF THE BUILD GRAPH (`//mod
    reconfigure;`) and their specs freeze them as dormant; the tenant copy additionally does
    not compile (bare-`{}` @PathBuf formats, E0277).

Must:
  Build the standalone workspace through `./parent.toml` so the image builds without the other
    binaries in the workspace.
  Ship `./templates/` and `./scripts/` into the image under the paths set by `TEMPLATE_DIRECTORY`
    and `SCRIPT_DIRECTORY`.
  Keep the CLI flags and exit codes described in `/docs/cli.md` stable unless the owning
    subcommand spec changes them.

Must not:
  Depend on the `operator` or `server` crates.
  Hand-edit `./parent.toml`; regenerate it with `cargo cmd generate`.

Depends on:
  ./common/common.sdd

Done when:
  Each subcommand submodule has a reviewed same-basename or nested directory spec, and
    `cargo test -p agent` is green.

Tasks:
  [x] #0 Spec the `./src/package/` and `./src/linting/` submodules.
  [x] #1 Spec the instance-operation submodules and `./src/testing/` harness.
  [x] #2 Spec the packaged `./scripts/` Rhai library under its own spec. Ledger
      `./scripts/scripts.sdd` accounts for all 120 `.rhai` files (66 same-basename specs,
      families, byte-identical twins with pointers); the five `./templates/*.hbs` ship with
      their same-basename specs. `specdd lint agent` green (122 specs, 0 errors 0 warnings).
  [ ] #3 Reconcile `/docs/cli.md` with the exit-code ladders and flag help frozen across the
      new specs (docs claim 0/1/2 only; ladders now span 1–5; `template_crds` empty-document
      and `High-availibity` typo also await a doc/decision pass).
